# Build contexts carry sources only: docker/app.Dockerfile installs (npm ci) and
# compiles (tsc -b) everything inside the image. Nothing below may ride along
# from a checkout — host-built binaries, dist/ of since-deleted sources, caches,
# reports, secrets — or a COPY would bake it into an image as it is.

# Version control and env files (secrets; no image reads .env.example either).
.git
**/.env*

# Dependencies, installed in the image: root, workspaces, tools/shops-e2e alike.
**/node_modules

# Build outputs, rebuilt from the sources in the image.
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Caches: apps/shops/tools/fetch-images.mjs downloads into this one.
apps/shops/tools/.cache

# Test reports (vitest coverage, Playwright).
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report

# Hidden scenario config from tools/build-shop-config.mjs (default --out, as in
# .gitignore): mounted at run time (SHOPS_SCENARIOS_FILE), never built in.
/shops-scenarios*.json
/shops-scenarios*.yaml

**/.DS_Store
